# Event extraction projection V2 regression checklist

- [ ] Fine-grained and direct occurrence histories can project to the same coarse anchors.
- [ ] Arbitrary reachability cannot satisfy a typed-path clause.
- [ ] Forbidden relations and paths are detected.
- [ ] Hindsight status errors fail independently of later resolution.
- [ ] True merge requires injective, source-backed and optionally incomparable contributions.
- [ ] REUSE without MERGE is representable and false MERGE is rejected.
- [ ] Candidate span hashes are absent and runner-derived hashes are deterministic.
- [ ] Anchor swallowing, extra-event overflow, duplicate signatures and source mismatch fail.
- [ ] Unknown fields, bool integers and non-finite JSON fail closed.
- [ ] Candidate bytes, event/edge counts and path search/enumeration have hard fail-closed budgets.
- [ ] Mechanical success remains pending blind manual review.
